    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The helper returns `refreshTokenResponse` itself (the Zod `safeParse` result), not `refreshTokenResponse.data`. In `packages/app-store/salesforce/lib/CalendarService.ts`, the caller immediately reads `accessTokenParsed.data` and persists `{ ...accessTokenParsed.data, refresh_token: credentialKey.refresh_token }`. That means the caller still depends on the wrapper shape, so any consumer expecting the raw token object from this helper will not get it, and the helper's return shape is no longer a plain parsed credential payload.",
